#: scripts/bosses/argantonio_boss.gd
msgid "Las crónicas me dieron por muerto. Se equivocaron."
msgstr "The chronicles gave me up for dead. They were wrong."

#: scripts/bosses/argantonio_boss.gd
msgid "Ven cómo eres: dos veces, y ninguna de ellas descansa."
msgstr "See what you are: twice over, and neither of them rests."

#: scripts/bosses/argantonio_boss.gd
msgid "Ya no recuerdo por qué me quedé."
msgstr "I no longer remember why I stayed."

#: scripts/bosses/argantonio_boss.gd
msgid "Golpéame, y termino. O déjame ir, y termino igual. Elige."
msgstr "Strike me, and I end. Or let me go, and I end all the same. Choose."

#: scripts/bosses/argantonio_boss.gd
msgid "Liberar a Argantonio"
msgstr "Free Argantonio"

#: scripts/bosses/argantonio_boss.gd
msgid "Gracias. Ya puedo dejar que pase."
msgstr "Thank you. Now I can let it pass."

#: scripts/bosses/briareus_boss.gd
msgid "Cien brazos, y ninguno para dejarte pasar."
msgstr "A hundred arms, and not one to let you through."

#: scripts/bosses/briareus_boss.gd
msgid "Lo vigilo desde antes de que hubiera nombre para el tiempo."
msgstr "I have watched over him since before time had a name."

